{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":53715,"seasonNumber":0},"checkedAt":1793441835766,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":0,"name":{"value":"Speciali","language":"it-IT"},"year":2013,"episodeCount":10,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rqjHLYf0b9Bt6sXQZZSAD2eHBmn.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"924517","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kyousuke impliments a Battle Ranking system, with Riki slowly moving up the ranks, whilst Yuiko has fun teasing the other girls by giving them dubious advice. Meanwhile, a mysterious fighter known as Mask the Saito appears and starts defeating other members of the Little Busters and moving to the top of the rankings. Mask the Saito then confronts Riki in a battle, but he is stopped by a moving story by Komari and admits defeat, revealing himself to be Kyousuke, who passes the mask onto Riki.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-08-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wjOS6XYwYYliZqkAAqUh6Kv35Y0.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wjOS6XYwYYliZqkAAqUh6Kv35Y0.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/53715/season/0/episode/1"},{"id":"2278649","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"While Riki Naoe goes to the classroom to pick up a Japanese lit notebook at nighttime, he is approached by Saya Tokido, who urges him to flee. After he hears a distant gunshot, he finds her abandoned student handbook left in the classroom.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2014-01-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/t2uTVtDZIsuhqraZU6SESZ28Z9o.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t2uTVtDZIsuhqraZU6SESZ28Z9o.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/53715/season/0/episode/2"},{"id":"2278650","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"理樹は沙耶のパートナーとなって、学園の地下に隠された迷宮を探索する。 迷宮内はさまざまなトラップが仕掛けられ、死と隣り合わせの危険な場所 だった。だが、理樹は持ち前の強運でなんとかピンチを切り抜けていく。 二人で「闇の執行部」と戦ったり、無邪気に遊んだりするうちに、 冷酷で計算高いと思っていた沙那の素顔が少しずつ見えてくる。 そして理樹はいつの間にか、彼女のペースに巻き込まれるのが 楽しくなっていることに気付くのだった。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2014-02-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1RNJH5cgWK1qqJ55QR6cOrjdAxm.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1RNJH5cgWK1qqJ55QR6cOrjdAxm.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/53715/season/0/episode/3"},{"id":"2278651","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"秘宝を探して迷宮を探索している理樹と沙耶は、地下５階に足を踏み入れた。沙耶の正体は謎のままだったが、いつしか理樹は彼女を愛おしく思うようになっていた。だが、なんとなくいい雰囲気になったふたりの前に、巨大な動く石像が立ちはだかる！　沙耶は銃を抜き、理樹は知恵を絞って攻略法を考える。次々と出現するトラップ。その先には一体何が待っているのだろうか？　最終決戦の場が近づきつつあった——。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2014-03-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wOuFC5nvl6eSNjtuF2ryfUArPPn.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wOuFC5nvl6eSNjtuF2ryfUArPPn.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/53715/season/0/episode/4"},{"id":"2278652","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"地下迷宮の奥深くに眠る「秘宝」とは何なのか——。理樹と沙耶はまだ見ぬ「秘宝」に思いを巡らせ、戦いが終わった後にデートをしようと語り合う。だが、その前に最後の決着をつけなければいけなかった。ふたりの前に立ちはだかったのは、闇の執行部部長・時風瞬。この迷宮の支配者であり、何度戦っても勝ち目がないほどの強敵だったが、沙耶には策があった。切り札である理樹を使って、沙耶は「ラストゲーム」に挑む。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2014-04-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iJWWPia0KkGBiyItzfZIgMaYzpf.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iJWWPia0KkGBiyItzfZIgMaYzpf.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/53715/season/0/episode/5"},{"id":"2278653","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ソフトボール部のホープでエース、笹瀬川佐々美。鈴のライバルを自称し、理樹たちとも馴れ合わない彼女だったが、鈴も知らない黒い猫になつかれているところを目撃される。するとその夜、しっぽにリボンを付けた謎の猫が理樹に必死につきまとい、寮の部屋まで付いてきてしまう。　そして深夜、眠りについた理樹のベッドにツインテールの少女の姿が!?　なんと猫の正体は……笹瀬川佐々美だった！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2014-05-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/q5YaS0g1rQ4chuy3dvnWw5TWhl7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q5YaS0g1rQ4chuy3dvnWw5TWhl7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/53715/season/0/episode/6"},{"id":"2278654","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"なぜか理樹の部屋から出ると猫に変身する体質になってしまった佐々美。元に戻る方法が見つからず、仕方なくふたりで同居生活を送ることに……。佐々美が手料理を作ったりしてまるで初々しい新婚気分だったが、理樹は世界のさらなる異変に気付き始めていた。なぜこんな事態になったのか原因を探そうとしているうちに、仲間たちにも次々と異変が起きてしまう。いったいこの奇妙な世界は、誰の意志によって生まれたのだろうか――？","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2014-06-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ntocQliKhPRZfK5Yt5iF0mIKvP6.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ntocQliKhPRZfK5Yt5iF0mIKvP6.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/53715/season/0/episode/7"},{"id":"2278655","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"理樹は部室の存続のために寮会を手伝うことになり、寮長室で二木佳奈多とふたりきりで作業を行う。風紀委員として恐れられる彼女はずっと不機嫌そうだったが理樹が粘り強く接しているうちに彼女の意外な一面が明らかに――。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2014-07-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rdXNhsdQN9oFoONcNeMJWwlUReA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rdXNhsdQN9oFoONcNeMJWwlUReA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/53715/season/0/episode/8"},{"id":"2278656","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"理樹と葉留佳は、佳奈多が自ら犠牲になって実家へ戻ろうとしていたことを知ってしまう。しかもすでに実家の人間は学園内に手を回していた――。リトルバスターズによる佳奈多救出ミッションがいま始まる！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2014-07-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kTkIpCW6z9j0qnlFdE1oK6rzN1e.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kTkIpCW6z9j0qnlFdE1oK6rzN1e.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/53715/season/0/episode/9"},{"id":"2762856","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"This anime adapts Key's visual novel Kud Wafter, which follows the romantic relationship between Riki Naoe and Kudryavka Noumi from the game Little Busters!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-11-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":50,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8F8GjU4yBbXU0NQtiFs6zOjovvR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8F8GjU4yBbXU0NQtiFs6zOjovvR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/53715/season/0/episode/10"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/53715/season/0"},"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{"2":{"checkedAt":1793441835766,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"3":{"checkedAt":1793441835766,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"4":{"checkedAt":1793441835766,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"5":{"checkedAt":1793441835766,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"6":{"checkedAt":1793441835766,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"7":{"checkedAt":1793441835766,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"8":{"checkedAt":1793441835766,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"9":{"checkedAt":1793441835766,"status":"ok","retryCount":0}}}
